    "description": "Deep learning is introduced as a powerful tool and potential solution for managing complex mobile environments, rising data volumes, and algorithm-driven applications in networking infrastructure. The paper aims to bridge the gap between deep learning and mobile/wireless networking research by:\n\n*   Introducing the essential background and state-of-the-art of deep learning techniques applicable to networking.\n*   Discussing techniques and platforms that facilitate the efficient deployment of deep learning onto mobile systems.\n*   Providing an encyclopedic review of mobile and wireless networking research that is based on deep learning, categorized by different domains.",
